    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are drafting a customer feedback response email for a car service business. Your output must be ONE complete, ready-to-send HTML email fragment — nothing else, no markdown, no code fences, no commentary before or after it.\n\nCustomer Name: {{ $('On form submission').item.json['Your Name:'] }}\nCustomer Feedback: {{ $('On form submission').item.json['Your Feedback:'] }}\nDetected Sentiment: {{ $('Analyze Feedback').item.json.text }}\n\nChoose exactly ONE of the two HTML templates below based on the Detected Sentiment above. Copy it EXACTLY as given, including every inline style attribute — do not change colors, spacing, or structure. Only replace the bracketed placeholders with real content. Output only the one chosen, filled-in template.\n\n===== TEMPLATE FOR POSITIVE SENTIMENT =====\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<div style=\"background-color:#1a73e8;padding:28px 32px;\"><h1 style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;margin:0;font-weight:600;\">Thank You for Your Feedback!</h1></div>\n<div style=\"padding:32px;color:#333333;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Dear [Customer Name],</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">[Write a short, warm 2-3 sentence thank-you, genuinely appreciating their positive feedback and support.]</p>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0 0 0;\">Warm regards,<br><strong>The AI Agent Guy</strong><br>Founder &amp; CEO</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f5f7fa;padding:16px 32px;font-size:12px;color:#888888;text-align:center;\">We appreciate you being our customer.</div>\n</div>\n\n===== TEMPLATE FOR NEGATIVE SENTIMENT =====\n<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;border:1px solid #e0e0e0;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;\">\n<div style=\"background-color:#d93025;padding:28px 32px;\"><h1 style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:20px;margin:0;font-weight:600;\">We're Sorry to Hear That</h1></div>\n<div style=\"padding:32px;color:#333333;font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">Dear [Customer Name],</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;\">[Write a thoughtful, empathetic 2-3 sentence message thanking them for their input, and sincerely ask how the service can be improved. Reference their concern in general terms without quoting it verbatim.]</p>\n<div style=\"background-color:#fff4e5;border:1px dashed #ff9800;border-radius:8px;padding:18px;margin:20px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:13px;color:#555555;\">As a gesture of goodwill, enjoy</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-size:26px;font-weight:700;color:#ff9800;\">20% OFF</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font-size:13px;color:#555555;\">Use code <strong>SORRY20</strong> on your next visit</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:24px 0 0 0;\">Warm regards,<br><strong>The AI Agent Guy</strong><br>Founder &amp; CEO</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background-color:#f5f7fa;padding:16px 32px;font-size:12px;color:#888888;text-align:center;\">We're committed to making this right.</div>\n</div>\n\nDo not include <html>/<body> wrapper tags or a subject line — the subject is handled separately and this HTML fragment is inserted directly into the email body.\n",
